e</sup>Etanercept arm was treated for 16 weeks versus 8 weeks for placebo patients;</p></fn><fn id="tfn11-btt-2-229"><p><sup>f</sup>The placebo-controlled duration of the trial lasted only 14 weeks, after which time all patients were treated with study drug for the duration of the 52-week study.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>